Subject: [PATCH] Enable OTP debug fallback and allow Vercel CORS

When GCP_IDENTITY_PLATFORM_API_KEY is unset (or OTP_DEBUG=true),
serve debug OTP 123456 so login works. Allow jWeb Vercel origins.
